.TH AVR\-CACHE\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.1.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-cache-list \- List cache entries for a repository.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr cache list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List cache entries for a repository.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr cache list --repo rep-abc123
    avr cache list --repo rep-abc123 --type gha --limit 50
    avr cache list --repo rep-abc123 --key "node_modules" --ref refs/heads/main
    avr cache list --repo rep-abc123 --json key,size_bytes,created_at
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    cache_type, created_at, hit_count, key, last_accessed_at, ref, size_bytes, version
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (org/repo or rep-xxx). Auto-detected from git remote if omitted.
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by cache type (e.g. gha, bazel, turbo, rclone).
.TP
\fB\-\-key\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by key prefix.
.TP
\fB\-\-ref\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter by exact ref match.
.TP
\fB\-L\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Max entries to return. (default: 100)
.TP
\fB\-\-offset\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Number of entries to skip. (default: 0)
.TP
\fB\-\-order\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Sort order. (choices: created_at.desc, created_at.asc; default: created_at.desc)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.TP
\fB\-\-web\fR
Open in browser.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-cache (1),
.BR avr-cache-delete (1),
.BR avr-cache-usage (1)
